-- The bounds are inclusive at millisecond precision
1970-01-01 00:16:41	2
1970-01-01 00:16:42	3
-- String arguments
1970-01-01 00:16:41	2
1970-01-01 00:16:42	3
1001	2
1002	3
-- The range is checked before the conversion to the scale of the table
-- The time range is before 1970
0
0
-- The time range starts before 1970 and reaches the samples at 0 and 1000
1970-01-01 00:00:00	0
1970-01-01 00:16:40	1
-- The time range is after 2106
0
0
-- The time range ends after 2106 and reaches the samples at 1003 and 4294967295
1970-01-01 00:16:43	4
2106-02-07 06:28:15	5
-- The time range covers the whole range of the type
6
6
